# NEBULA Space Portal

A large futuristic static website starter.

## Pages
- `index.html` — landing page
- `games.html` — arcade catalogue
- `viewer.html` — embedded web previewer
- `lab.html` — sandboxed custom HTML lab
- `about.html` — system/roadmap

## Add games
Put game HTML files in `games/`, then add a card and launcher in `games.html` / `js/games.js`.

## Deploy
Upload the whole folder to any static host.

## Security
The web viewer is intentionally an iframe previewer, not an unrestricted proxy. If you add a backend fetcher later, use authentication, destination controls, rate limiting, logging and abuse protection.
